  "id": "11",
  "title": "Prism 模板引擎",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366F1\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"M2 17l10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**Prism** 是 Photon 的高效能折射引擎。受 Laravel Blade 的啟發，它將極具表現力的模板編譯為原始 JavaScript 閉包，實現近乎即時的渲染速度。</p></div><h2>視圖編譯器 (The View Compiler)</h2><p>與在運行時解析字串的傳統模板引擎不同，Prism 利用了 **AOT (超前編譯) 視圖編譯器**。您的 HTML 在啟動階段會經過嚴格分析，並轉換為優化的執行路徑。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(99,102,241,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #6366F1; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"16 18 22 12 16 6\"/><polyline points=\"8 6 2 12 8 18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">邏輯驅動</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">完整支援條件指令 (<code>@if</code>) 與迭代迴圈 (<code>@each</code>)，無需任何上下文切換開銷。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(99,102,241,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #6366F1; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">插槽系統</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">強大的組件架構，具備具名插槽與 Props，實現深度的 DRY 原則 UI 組合。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(99,102,241,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #6366F1; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">堆疊管理</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">從巢狀視圖將腳本與樣式「推送」至母版佈局，不會破壞文件結構。</p></div></div><h2>折射語法</h2><p>Prism 的語法設計旨在直觀且具表現力。它結合了大括號的簡潔與 Laravel 風格指令的強大功能。</p><pre><code>@extends('layouts/app')\n\n@section('content')\n  &lt;h1&gt;你好, {{ user.name }}&lt;/h1&gt;\n  \n  &lt;x-alert type=\"success\"&gt;\n    您的個人資料已更新。\n  &lt;/x-alert&gt;\n\n  &lt;ul&gt;\n    {{#each items as item}}\n      &lt;li&gt;{{ item.title }}&lt;/li&gt;\n    {{/each}}\n  &lt;/ul&gt;\n@endsection</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #6366F1; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 編譯器規格：字串消除</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">模板中的字串實體在編譯期間會被預先串接。生成的 JS 函數會直接執行單個 <code>return</code> 返回預建好的緩衝區，最小化中間字串分配。</p></div><h2>效能基準測試</h2><p>渲染開銷對比：Prism (AOT) vs 傳統字串替換引擎 (1萬次簡單渲染)。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6366F1; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PRISM_AOT_渲染</span> <span>平均 0.004ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 10%; background: #6366F1; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(99,102,241,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>通用 SSR 引擎</span> <span>平均 0.210ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 85%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 指標：AOT 編譯將視圖延遲降低了超過 50 倍</p></div><h2>超媒體混合化 (Hypermedia Hybridization)</h2><p>Prism 是 **HTMX** 的完美拍檔。它允許您返回細粒度的 HTML 片段，卻能擁有與 SPA 相當的流暢體驗，且無需載入龐大的 JS Bundle。</p><pre><code>// 僅返回用於 HTMX 交換的列表片段\napp.get('/api/users', (c) => {\n  const view = c.get('view')\n  return c.html(view.render('partials/user-list'))\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**建築師洞見：** Prism 不僅僅是一個模板引擎，它是伺服器端渲染 (SSR) 與現代 Web 標準交互性之間的橋樑。在對效能要求極高的併發應用中，它是不可或缺的選擇。</p></div>",
